  "answer": "化简为 \\(\\frac{x-1}{x+3}\\)，值为 \\(1-2\\sqrt2\\)。",
  "given_answer": "",
  "given_solution": "",
  "given_solution_figures": [],
  "solution_steps": [
    "原式要求 \\(x\\ne-1,1,-3\\)。括号内为 \\(\\frac{2x+2-x+1}{x+1}=\\frac{x+3}{x+1}\\)，除以分式改为乘其倒数。",
    "原式 \\(=\\frac{x+3}{x+1}\\cdot\\frac{(x-1)(x+1)}{(x+3)^2}=\\frac{x-1}{x+3}\\)。代入 \\(x=\\sqrt2-3\\)，得 \\(\\frac{\\sqrt2-4}{\\sqrt2}=1-2\\sqrt2\\)。"
  ],
